            <h3 data-number="5.1.8"
            id="example-mandatory-elements"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.1.8</span> Example:
            Mandatory elements</h3>
            <p>The following XML code snippet shows the use of the
            mandatory elements in the record describing the “<a
            href="https://www.bildindex.de/document/obj00076417">Mona
            Lisa</a>” provided by Deutsches Dokumentationszentrum für
            Kunstgeschichte - Bildarchiv Foto Marburg. Note that the
            value for the Object/Work Type is adapted to follow Cutter’s
            rule of using the most specific descriptor. </p>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb26"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb26-1"><a href="#cb26-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:lido</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-2"><a href="#cb26-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:lidoRecID</span></span>
<span id="cb26-3"><a href="#cb26-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">        lido:source=</span><span class="st">&quot;ld.zdb-services.de/resource/organisations/DE-Mb112&quot;</span></span>
<span id="cb26-4"><a href="#cb26-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">        lido:type=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00099&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-5"><a href="#cb26-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>        ld.zdb-services.de/resource/organisations/DE-Mb112/lido/obj/00076417</span>
<span id="cb26-6"><a href="#cb26-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;/<span class="kw">lido:lidoRecID</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-7"><a href="#cb26-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:descriptiveMetadata</span><span class="ot"> xml:lang=</span><span class="st">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-8"><a href="#cb26-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>        &lt;<span class="kw">lido:objectClassificationWrap</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-9"><a href="#cb26-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>            &lt;<span class="kw">lido:objectWorkTypeWrap</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-10"><a href="#cb26-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                &lt;<span class="kw">lido:objectWorkType</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-11"><a href="#cb26-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                    &lt;<span class="kw">skos:Concept</span></span>
<span id="cb26-12"><a href="#cb26-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">                        rdf:about=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb26-13"><a href="#cb26-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                        &lt;<span class="kw">skos:prefLabel</span></span>
<span id="cb26-